Package: argon-oneup-essentials
Version: 1.4.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Description: Essential hardware configuration and APT repository for Argon ONE UP laptop
 Sets up the official Argon ONE UP APT repository and ensures essential hardware
 configuration parameters are written to /boot/firmware/config.txt:
  - External display-lid Wi-Fi/BT antenna selection (dtparam=ant2)
  - M.2 NVMe PCIe Gen 3 full-speed mode (dtparam=nvme, pciex1_gen=3)
  - Hardware I2C bus enablement (dtparam=i2c_arm=on)
  - 4-stage quiet blower fan curve with 5C hysteresis
  - Official APT archive keyring and sources list
